jira-id: DT-764
RUN.SH
	check if md5sum of nvpmodel_t186_p3636.conf and the nvpmodel_org.conf in RAR folder is same and log it
	Take backup of /etc/nvpmodel/nvpmodel_t186_p3636.conf by renaming it as nvpmodel_t186_p3636_backup.conf
	log the output of nvpmodel -q –verbose
	now place the nvpmodel_t186_p3636.conf in the RAR folder in /etc/nvpmodel 	
	Run the command nvpmodel -m 3
	log the output of nvpmodel -q –verbose
	output of : cat /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu1/online should be 1
	output of : cat /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu2/online should be 1
	output of : cat /sys/devices/17000000.gp10b/devfreq/17000000.gp10b/max_freq should be 1134750000
	run the systemd_override_b3.sh script
	reboot
 
REVERT.SH
	remove current /etc/nvpmodel/nvpmodel_t186_p3636.conf and rename backup back to its original name
	Run the command nvpmodel -m 3
	log the output of nvpmodel -q –verbose
	output of : cat /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu1/online should be 0
	output of : cat /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu2/online should be 0
	output of : cat /sys/devices/17000000.gp10b/devfreq/17000000.gp10b/max_freq should be 1134750000
	run the command find /etc/systemd/system/ -type d -name "*.service.d" | xargs rm -rf
    reboot
Steps followed as above for the run.sh and revert.sh 
